---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Contact & Book | AOC, Calgary";
const description = "Check consultation availability and contact information for Alex Orlando Counselling in Calgary, Alberta.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
<main id="main"><div class="wrap"><section class="page-head"><div class="eyebrow">Contact / Book · Calgary, Alberta</div><h1>A first conversation.<br>A possible next step.</h1><p class="lead">A chance to ask questions and consider whether AOC is a good fit for what you need.</p></section><div class="content-grid"><section class="contact-panel"><span class="status">Booking not yet open</span><h2>Consultations<br>are coming.</h2><p>Online scheduling and contact details are not yet available. No appointment or request can be submitted through this website at this time.</p><p>Confirmed availability, consultation details, fees, and a booking link will appear here when appointments open.</p><a class="btn outline" href="/faq/">Read the FAQ ↗</a></section><aside class="prose"><h3 style="margin-top:0">Before a consultation</h3><p>You might consider what brought you here, what you hope could change, and any questions about qualifications, approach, or practical arrangements.</p><h3>Need support sooner?</h3><p>This site is not monitored for urgent requests. Explore current <a href="https://www.albertahealthservices.ca/amh/amh.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Alberta support options</a>. In immediate danger or a medical emergency, call <a href="tel:911">911</a>.</p></aside></div></div></main>
</Layout>
